\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Main risk points\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 The key issue isn't necessarily 
\f1\b whether you're willing to be tough
\f0\b0 . It is whether toughness becomes 
\f1\b instrumental, dismissive, or unnecessarily intimidating
\f0\b0 .\
A leader can be ethical in intention yet still create fear, silence dissent, or normalize collateral damage.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 2. The top 3 risks to monitor\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 1. Strategic manipulation becoming your default operating system\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Your Machiavellianism score is the clearest signal here.\
The risk isn't simply \'93being manipulative.\'94 It is beginning to think that relationships primarily exist in terms of leverage, alliances, incentives and usefulness.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

