\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Your profile suggests a leader with 
\f1\b strong strategic instincts, relatively high decisiveness and emotional toughness
\f0\b0 , combined with 
\f1\b high humility, meaningful empathy and a solid ethical orientation
\f0\b0 .\
Your biggest developmental task is probably not becoming \'93nicer.\'94 It is learning to ensure that your 
\f1\b power, speed and strategic thinking do not outrun transparency, psychological safety and consideration for impact
